        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sathish Kalathil, Jacques Feyder\n- Works: Jalachhayam, Veena Vaadanam\n- Topics: Malayalam cinema, experimental films, documentary films\n\nFacts:\n- Jacques Feyder was born on 21 July 1885 and died on 24 May 1948.\n- Jacques Feyder was a Belgian actor, screenwriter, and film director who worked principally in France and also in the USA, Britain, and Germany.\n- Sathish Kalathil is known in the Malayalam cinema industry for his experimental works.\n- Sathish Kalathil's debut film Jalachhayam was released in 2010 and was discussed for its experimental approach.\n- Veena Vaadanam, also called Recital of Music, is an Indian documentary film in the Malayalam language directed by Sathish Kalathil.",
